        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"So Sorry, I Said\", \"Results\", \"Cabaret\"\n- People: Liza Minnelli, Bob Fosse\n- Roles: Sally Bowles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1972, Liza Minnelli played Sally Bowles in the musical film \"Cabaret\", which was directed by Bob Fosse.\n- Liza Minnelli is primarily known for her Academy Award-winning role as Sally Bowles in \"Cabaret\".\n- Liza Minnelli is noted for her energetic stage presence and powerful contralto singing voice.\n- \"So Sorry, I Said\" is the third single taken from Liza Minnelli's album \"Results\".",
